            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Remote isn't responding:</strong> confirm the vehicle's ignition or ACC circuit is on — GhostTint draws power only when ACC is live, with no separate battery to charge.</li><li><strong>Film won't sit flat:</strong> re-wet the glass and re-squeegee outward from the center to push out trapped air before the adhesive sets.</li><li><strong>Bubbles appear after a few days:</strong> small bubbles usually clear as the adhesive fully cures over 48–72 hours; if they persist, get in touch.</li></ul>"
